[audio]
- Working via gstreamer pipelines
- See *P and *T pipelines for pink noise and single tone tests, if audio.debug is true

[cat]
- Basic yaesu style CAT is acceptable on dev/ttyCAT0 device
- Skeleton of KPA500 style CAT support

[gps]
- Basic NMEA generator for static positions of rigs/stations
- NMEA proxying via sercom

[sercom]
- Support for exposing generated or proxied NMEA data on pty or serial
- Support for yaesu CAT on pty or serial
- Support for proxying remote sercom port to local pty

[rigs]
- Internal backend stores rig state and is a good base for new radio support
- Support using hamlib backend to control other rigs

[websocket]
- Working, using libmongoose
